     -h _h_o_s_t Set ypbind's binding on _h_o_s_t, instead of locally.
             _h_o_s_t can be specified as a name or as an IP address.

     -d _d_o_m_a_i_n
             Use _d_o_m_a_i_n , instead of the default domain.

SEE ALSO
     ypwhich(1), ypserv(8), ypfiles(5)















































